+    /**
+     * `current` is the stored set in the same wire shape the floor reads it in, so a phone can offer
+     * "Use theirs" from it without a second read; `updatedBy`/`updatedAt` name the last PATCH that
+     * stamped the set (decision `set-authorship-stamps`).
